{'symbol': 'PLD', 'date': '2022-06-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'PROLOGIS COMMITS TO NET ZERO EMISSIONS BY 2040', 'text': "SETS INTERIM TARGETS OF 1 GW SOLAR BY 2025 AND NET ZERO FOR OPERATIONS BY 2030 BUILDS ON COMPANY'S LEADERSHIP IN GREEN BUILDING, SOLAR AND MORE PUBLISHES 2021-22 ESG REPORT SAN FRANCISCO, JUNE 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PROLOGIS (NYSE: PLD), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN LOGISTICS REAL ESTATE, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS COMMITMENT TO ACHIEVE NET ZERO EMISSIONS ACROSS ITS VALUE CHAIN BY 2040. THE COMPANY ALSO RELEASED ITS ANNUAL ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) PERFORMANCE REPORT."}